# The build context is the repository root, which is not a small directory: the
# Parquet mirror alone is hundreds of files. Everything the image needs is
# pyproject.toml, README.md and src/ — the rest only slows the build and would
# ship internal material into an image that gets pushed to a registry.
*
!pyproject.toml
!README.md
!src/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
